fix = "Move the accountId answer of the fixture to the node root route ahead of the recorded-traffic lookup and drop the /rpc arm; the production call is right."

[gotcha.3237]
title = "The explorer search field reads Search or ask: a transaction, address, block or token (SearchBarInput.tsx line 124) since the restyle, and nothing answers a question: no page API route calls a model (apps/explorer/pages/api holds config, csrf, healthz, log, metrics, monitoring, proxy and media-type routes only) and the design brief section 8 left the assistant to a separate owner decision."
