title = "22.36.3 attempt 1: the sixteen documentation files moved and three of four cases pass; test_no_tracked_references_to_retired_wallet_documentation_paths fails on docker/wallet-pwa/Dockerfile.dockerignore line 28, which still lists services/wallet/docs, and apps/wallet/README.md lines 28 to 32 link docs/architecture/README.md, docs/architecture/storage-forensics.md, docs/api/README.md, docs/development/README.md, docs/deployment/README.md and docs/operations/runbooks.md relative to apps/wallet, links the move broke; both files sit outside the task scope."
