[gotcha.3241]
title = "22.36.2 attempt 1 (109 files): four of seven cases pass; the candidate tree lacks services/platform/examples/samples/verify-receipt-rust/Cargo.lock although the lockfile was tracked at the old path and no ignore rule of the main tree matches the new path; twelve files outside the scope still name services/platform/docs (tools/bringup/docs-names.sh line 7, tools/deps/floors/platform-node.json line 28, tools/paxeer-x/gates/104.16.5.sh lines 30 to 31, 104.33.5.sh line 21, 108.0.7.sh lines 41 and 77 to 78, tools/platform/cli/tests/clean-bootstrap.sh line 56, tools/qualification/audit_repairs/test_repair_22_33_1500.py line 18, test_repair_22_33_849.py line 580, tools/qualification/tests/test_repair_22_33_809.py line 15, tools/workspace/platform-dependency-roots.txt lines 3 to 5, and the two repair records tools/bringup/repair-m794.kvx and tools/qualification/audit_repairs/repair_22_33_1500.kvx); and docs/platform/content/reference/human-api.md is stale against services/human/schema/human-api (committed page minor 5, generator minor 10)."
