[gotcha.3264]
title = "22.99.77 attempt 19 (after 22.31.569): build and dependent checks exit 0 twice, verify exit 101 twice: all twelve native proofs of tests/support/native_replay.rs (f03_evaluator_host, host_boundary, rewards_native) answer EngineFault deterministic execution observer refused: SupplementRejected at execution_supplement.retained_limit at height 1000; the three evaluator mutations now fit the CPU cap and five operations remain 4 to 139 fuel over it (OPEN_EPOCH at 896 and 1024 state bytes 1000139 and 1000006, RevealScore at 1104 1000004, 1000015 and 1000007)."
symptom = "execution_supplement (programs/crates/layerx-programs-runtime/src/host/mod.rs lines 748 to 761) refuses when the retained bytes of one boundary exceed the remaining bytes or the remaining work of the observer, and the observer (programs/vendor/wasmi-0.31.2/src/store.rs lines 183 to 212 and 1855 to 1869) aggregates the whole charge of every boundary, including memory_bytes equal to the full linear memory of the instance (store.rs line 816), against MAX_TRACE_STATE_BYTES of 64 mebibytes; a Rust guest built without a stack-size link argument (programs/.cargo/config.toml) carries the default one-mebibyte stack, so its memory is at least 17 pages and the aggregate is exhausted after about 58 boundaries while the AI market CALL at a 50-kilobyte state crosses many more; the 569 proof guest declares two memory pages and four host calls and never reaches the limit. The witness leaves of the replay record are bounded separately by the profile maximum (execute.rs lines 1118 to 1175) and do not carry the memory."
fix = "Task 22.31.573 charges a boundary with the state it retains (the first retained snapshot in full, each later one with the pages changed since the previous retained snapshot plus the instance and host-state deltas) and proves a 17-page guest with 128 host calls; 22.99.77 continues after it and brings the five residual operations under the cap."

[gotcha.3265]
